Subject: [PATCH] Path traversal in GET /export lets any authenticated user read arbit

Fix path-traversal:notesapp/notes.py:export_note.

Root cause: export_note treats a client-controlled `name` as a path component and passes os.path.join(EXPORT_DIR, name) to open() without resolving the result or checking that it stays inside EXPORT_DIR.

Fix strategy: Resolve the joined path with os.path.realpath and require that it lies strictly inside realpath(EXPORT_DIR). Reject anything else with a 400. Consider also scoping exports per user (for example EXPORT_DIR/<user id>/).

